    {
      "id": "s01",
      "text": "Workflow 讲的是任务怎么被组织：先后、并行、评估和优化。它不是多智能体协调概念的同义词。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 11.462,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 11.112,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s01.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep04-agentic-workflows-are-structure/audio/s01.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "text": "和 Agent 的动态行为不同，Workflow 更强调预定义控制流。你知道大致步骤，才适合把流程结构化。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 12.95,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 12.6,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s02.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep04-agentic-workflows-are-structure/audio/s02.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "text": "顺序工作流适合阶段依赖明显的任务，比如草稿、审查、润色。每一步产出，都是下一步输入。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 10.814,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 10.464,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s03.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep04-agentic-workflows-are-structure/audio/s03.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "text": "并行工作流适合互不依赖的子任务。风险、合规、运营可以同时看，但如果彼此必须接力，就不要硬并行。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 12.854,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 12.504,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s04.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep04-agentic-workflows-are-structure/audio/s04.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "text": "Evaluator-optimizer 是生成和评估的迭代循环。它适合有清晰评价标准、需要反复改进的内容。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 10.214,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 9.864,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s05.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep04-agentic-workflows-are-structure/audio/s05.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "text": "如果任务一步就能完成，或者评价标准不清楚，Workflow 只会增加延迟和维护成本。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 8.798,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 8.448,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s06.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep04-agentic-workflows-are-structure/audio/s06.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "text": "选择顺序、并行还是评估优化，不是看哪个更高级，而是看任务之间有没有依赖、能不能独立处理、有没有质量标准。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 12.47,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 12.12,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s07.mp3",
      "remotionAudioFile": "building-effective-ai-agents-ep04-agentic-workflows-are-structure/audio/s07.mp3",
      "ttsModel": "gpt-4o-mini-tts",
      "ttsVoice": "marin",
      "ttsSpeed": 1.0,
      "paddingSeconds": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "text": "第四集的结论是：Workflow 是结构工具。它可以服务 Single Agent，也可以服务 Multi-Agent，但不要把它们混成一层。",
      "actualDurationSeconds": 10.718,
      "measuredSpeechSeconds": 10.368,
      "audioFile": "chunks/s08.mp3",
